<!-- pages/preview/preview.wxml -->
<!-- 固定微信外壳：导航与输入栏固定，只有聊天区纵向滚动。 -->
<view class="wx {{themeClass}}" style="{{viewportStyle}}">
  <view class="wx-nav" style="{{navStyle}}">
    <view class="wx-nav-row" style="{{navRowStyle}}">
      <view class="back" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回" bindtap="onBack">‹</view>
      <view class="name">小鹿</view>
    </view>

    <view
      class="theme-toggle"
      style="{{themeToggleStyle}}"
      aria-role="button"
      aria-label="{{themeToggleLabel}}"
      bindtap="onToggleTheme"
    >
      <view class="theme-slider {{themeMode === 'dark' ? 'theme-slider-dark' : ''}}"></view>
      <view class="theme-segment {{themeMode === 'light' ? 'active' : ''}}">
        <image class="theme-icon" src="/assets/preview-ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="sr-only">普通模式</text>
      </view>
      <view class="theme-segment {{themeMode === 'dark' ? 'active' : ''}}">
        <image class="theme-icon" src="/assets/preview-ui/moon.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="sr-only">深色模式</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view
    class="wx-body"
    scroll-y="{{!scrollLock}}"
    enhanced="true"
    show-scrollbar="{{false}}"
    bindscroll="onChatScroll"
  >
    <view class="wx-body-inner">
      <view class="wx-time">{{chatTime}}</view>

      <block wx:for="{{groupList}}" wx:for-item="g" wx:for-index="gi" wx:key="key">
        <view class="msg me stackmsg">
          <view class="avatar mine cat-avatar" aria-label="猫咪头像"><image class="cat-avatar-image" src="/assets/preview-ui/cat-avatar.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
          <view class="stackmsg-content">
            <view
              hidden="{{g.expanded}}"
              class="stackwrap"
              style="{{g.stageStyle}}"
              data-gi="{{gi}}"
              aria-role="button"
              aria-label="{{g.name}}，左右滑动切换，点击查看大图"
              bindtap="onStackTap"
              bindtouchstart="onStackTouchStart"
              bindtouchmove="onStackTouchMove"
              bindtouchend="onStackTouchEnd"
              bindtouchcancel="onStackTouchCancel"
              bindlongpress="onStackLongPress"
            >
              <view
                wx:for="{{g.nodes}}"
                wx:for-item="nd"
                wx:for-index="ni"
                wx:key="index"
                class="stk {{nd.pos}} {{g.dragging ? 'tracking' : ''}} {{g.settling ? 'settling' : ''}} {{ni === g.frontIdx ? 'front-active' : ''}} {{nd.incoming ? 'incoming' : ''}} {{ni === g.noanimIdx ? 'noanim' : ''}}"
                style="{{nd.motionStyle}}"
              >
                <view class="stack-card" style="{{nd.cardStyle}}">
                  <image wx:if="{{!nd.err}}" class="card-img" src="{{nd.url}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="{{false}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" data-kind="node" data-ni="{{ni}}" binderror="onImgError" />
                  <view wx:else class="img-fallback"><text class="fallback-icon">▧</text><text>图片加载失败</text></view>
                </view>
              </view>
            </view>

            <view hidden="{{!g.expanded}}" class="xcard" style="{{g.stageStyle}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" data-url="{{g.cards[0].url}}" bindtap="onOpenViewer" bindlongpress="onCardLongPress">
              <view class="stack-card" style="{{g.cards[0].cardStyle}}">
                <image wx:if="{{!g.cards[0].err}}" class="card-img" src="{{g.cards[0].url}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="{{false}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" data-kind="card" data-ci="{{0}}" binderror="onImgError" />
                <view wx:else class="img-fallback"><text class="fallback-icon">▧</text><text>图片加载失败</text></view>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="expand-cap" wx:if="{{g.n > 1}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="{{g.expanded ? '收起' : '展开' + g.n + '张'}}" bindtap="onToggleCapsule">{{g.expanded ? '收起' : '展开 ' + g.n}}</view>
          <view class="gesture-tip" wx:if="{{gi === 0 && guideVisible}}">左右滑动切换 · 点展开查看全部</view>
        </view>

        <view wx:for="{{g.rest}}" wx:for-item="cd" wx:for-index="ki" wx:key="num" hidden="{{!g.expanded}}" class="msg me xrow {{g.leaving ? 'leave' : 'enter'}}" style="animation-delay: {{g.leaving ? cd.leaveDelay : cd.enterDelay}}ms;">
          <view class="avatar mine cat-avatar" aria-label="猫咪头像"><image class="cat-avatar-image" src="/assets/preview-ui/cat-avatar.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
          <view class="xcard" style="{{g.stageStyle}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" data-url="{{cd.url}}" bindtap="onOpenViewer" bindlongpress="onCardLongPress">
            <view class="stack-card" style="{{cd.cardStyle}}">
              <image wx:if="{{!cd.err}}" class="card-img" src="{{cd.url}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="{{false}}" data-gi="{{gi}}" data-kind="rest" data-ci="{{ki}}" binderror="onImgError" />
              <view wx:else class="img-fallback"><text class="fallback-icon">▧</text><text>图片加载失败</text></view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </block>

      <view class="empty-state" wx:if="{{isEmpty}}">
        <view class="empty-icon">▧</view>
        <view class="empty-text">{{inputError || '没有可预览的图片'}}</view>
        <view class="empty-action" aria-role="button" bindtap="onBack">返回整理素材</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view wx:if="{{canSaveCurrent && !isEmpty}}" class="preview-save-bar"><button class="preview-save-button" disabled="{{saveBusy}}" bindtap="onSaveCurrentPreview"><image class="save-download-icon" src="/assets/preview-ui/download.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>保存到相册</text></button></view>
  <view class="wx-inputbar" aria-role="button" aria-label="预览模式，点击查看说明" bindtap="onInputHint">
    <text class="input-icon">◉</text>
    <view class="field">预览模式</view>
    <text class="input-icon">☺</text>
    <text class="input-icon input-plus">＋</text>
  </view>

  <view class="viewer" wx:if="{{viewer.show}}" catchtap="onCloseViewer">
    <image class="vimg" src="{{viewer.url}}" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="vtip">点任意处关闭</view>
  </view>
  <canvas type="2d" id="previewExportCanvas" class="preview-export-canvas" />
  <view wx:if="{{saveStatus}}" class="preview-save-mask" catchtouchmove="onSaveMaskTouch" catchtap="onDismissSave">
    <view class="preview-save-dialog"><view wx:if="{{saveBusy}}" class="preview-save-spinner"></view><view class="preview-save-status">{{saveStatus}}</view><button wx:if="{{saveDone && !saveBusy}}" catchtap="onGoWechat">去微信发送</button><text wx:if="{{!saveBusy}}" class="preview-save-close">点击关闭</text></view>
  </view>
</view>
